INSTALL
-------
IMPORTANT NOTE about Applets :
if you run a JFCApplet locally, you must manually set the jxa.localApplet property to enabled (-Djxa.localApplet=true),
otherwise you may experience some Class cast error with serialization.
----------------------


To build with ant :
extract the tarball into a folder;
open shell and browse to the folder;
ant clean

To pack into .jar (dist/yourOSname/) :
ant jar

On Linux, to install into /usr/games/projectname) :
su
ant install

On Windows, you can build an .exe file :
ant install

On Mac OS X, you can build an .app bundle (stub, .plist and icons are located in resources/Mac/all) :
ant install

To build and run applet/application without install :
ant run-applet
  or
ant run